paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/8c4d8fa70bbd4462d5cfc63f29b3e5dc.poster.avif?t=1768226961\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/8c4d8fa70bbd4462d5cfc63f29b3e5dc.webm?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/8c4d8fa70bbd4462d5cfc63f29b3e5dc.mp4?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will need to forage plants and hunt animals for food, medicine or buff items which can be used to gain statistical benefits. Cooking items such as meat, herbs or spices found can be brought to a campfire where they can be combined into the perfect safari meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/1044f9e582c4f01b74f8be08d901eca8.poster.avif?t=1768226961\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/1044f9e582c4f01b74f8be08d901eca8.webm?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/1044f9e582c4f01b74f8be08d901eca8.mp4?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Building System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will need to setup camps and bases by harvesting materials such as logs, sticks and stones found around the map, These materials are combined to create buildings such as foundations or walls including functional structures such as water collectors and transporters, campfires or storage devices. Kalahari's End attempts to provide users with as little building limitations as possible to allow players to express their true creativity utilizing the building system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/9a7731ec35688a1aef3af740b0b36660.poster.avif?t=1768226961\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/9a7731ec35688a1aef3af740b0b36660.webm?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/9a7731ec35688a1aef3af740b0b36660.mp4?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great Tourist Location!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While considering the harsh components of the Kalahari, It is also important to recognize the leisure activities provided such as a nice swim followed by an ice cold drink under the warm sun. The Kalahari can be the perfect tourist location if one knows their environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/5a006f1e8ed9cfaaa17b99e768f5873b.poster.avif?t=1768226961\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/5a006f1e8ed9cfaaa17b99e768f5873b.webm?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/5a006f1e8ed9cfaaa17b99e768f5873b.mp4?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Healing Animations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will encounter all sorts of ailments and injuries in their stay at the Kalahari, Some including only small wounds or cuts while other may include more painful and urgent injuries such as fractured bones or deep cuts. Players will need to ensure that they have the correct medical herbs or equipment to deal with any situation they may encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/5e77077b85d622b2c4bbf29262c1451c.poster.avif?t=1768226961\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/5e77077b85d622b2c4bbf29262c1451c.webm?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/extras/5e77077b85d622b2c4bbf29262c1451c.mp4?t=1768226961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base building,</strong> Chop trees and harvest materials to build your perfect safari base.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooking,</strong> Find and combine food items such as meat, herbs and spices to make various African delicacies. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Temperature effects,</strong> Players will face harsh temperatures such as heatstroke throughout the day and hypothermia in the cold nights.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting,</strong> Scrap and crafting materials can be found around the map which are used to create custom weapons and tools.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic healing,</strong> To increase the realism for Kalahari's End, Players will experience a range of realistic injuries ranging from small cuts to large lacerations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you be able to survive the Kalahari?</strong></i></p>","developers":["Owlfig Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827400/header.jpg?t=1768226961","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827400/721436/e7c765e8b7803072b769fe69db1ce47050c9aedf/1750945221/dash_av1.mpd?t=1719929591","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827400/721436/e7c765e8b7803072b769fe69db1ce47050c9aedf/1750945221/dash_h264.mpd?t=1719929591","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827400/721436/e7c765e8b7803072b769fe69db1ce47050c9aedf/1750945221/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1719929591","id":257035327,"name":"Base Building Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257035327/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1719929591"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827400/659448/d233fea678f9e12387beb1f0f8dc816f461f8c29/1750945219/dash_av1.mpd?t=1707563885","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2827400/659448/d233fea678f9e12387beb1f0f8dc816f461f8c29/1750945219/dash_h264.mpd?t=1707563885","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstat